{
  "slug": "claude-music",
  "name": "Claude Music",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Music for your Claude Code sessions. Stream enjoyable background music across different genres (lofi, jazz, classical, ambient, EDM, and more) from the internet — right in your terminal. No accounts, no setup, just /play.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **21 skills**, **2 agents** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (21): `dj` (DJ — auto-picks the best genre for your session), `feedback` (Feedback — report a bug or share feedback on GitHub), `focus` (Focus — pomodoro timer with music that fades when time's up), `help` (Help — all the commands and genres you can use), `list` (List all available genres and their stations), `mood` (Mood — tell the DJ how you're feeling and it picks the right music), `mute` (Mute — silence the music without stopping the stream), `next` (Next — skip to a different stream in the same genre), and 13 more\n- **Agents** (2): `dj` (Analyzes the current coding task and picks appropriate background music), `soundcheck` (Automatically detects the platform and installs a compatible audio player for music playback)\n- **Hooks** (3): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-music@claude-community` from `kennethleungty/claude-music`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 21,
    "agent": 2,
    "hook": 3
  },
